# Feature: Attendance & Class Administration
**Feature ID:** 3
**Branch pattern:** `feature/N-Attendance-Class`
**Status:** Draft
**Created:** 2026-09-07

## User Stories
---

### US-N.1: Attendance Tracking
**As a** Admin
**I want to** Mark attendance of members and guests 
**So that** I can see the rate of returning and new people

### US-N.2: Member attendance
**As a** Member 
**I want to** be able to sign in during Bible class and/or Service
**So that** The church can know I regularly attend

### US-N.3: Guest Access
**As a** Guest
**I want to** Enter my information for the church
**So that** The church can see that I was there and if I want to request more information about the church

## Functional Requirements
---
- **FR-001**: System MUST allow guests and members to sign in and show that they attended
- **FR-002**: System MUST allow admins to mark attendence of members and guests
- **FR-002**: System MUST allow admins to see data about attendence record and activity

## Gherkin AC
---
#### Scenario: Member wants to sign in
* **Given** A member that needs to sign in
* **When** The member successfully signs in to mark that they were there
* **Then** The church can see that they are active in the church

#### Scenario: Admin wants to check attendance
* **Given** Admin can successfully login to system
* **When** Admin can see attendance 
* **Then** members can be marked active or inactive based on attendance and add guests who want to become a member